-/* base case division: divides taba[0..na-1] by tabb[0..nb-1]. tabb[nb
-   - 1] must be >= 1 << (JS_LIMB_BITS - 1). na - nb must be >= 0. 'taba'
-   is modified and contains the remainder (nb limbs). tabq[0..na-nb]
