-// L0 measurement probes (docs/vm/quickjs-freertos-vm-spec.md sec.5). Every
-// declaration here is only meaningful, and only compiled in, with
-// CONFIG_POCKET_VM_PROBE on -- see main/Kconfig.projbuild. Call sites in
