-     * :9 below. With ALIGN_SIZE_LOG2 fixed at 2, fl_index_shift maxes out
-     * at sl_index_count_log2(5)+2=7 (fits :3) and small_block_size at
-     * 1<<7=128 (fits :8) - IDF sized these bitfields exactly to that case
